          "id": "1768151994231",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1768151994234_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "#Input\n {{$context.$nodes.FORMATOUTPUTDATA.$output.result}} \n#Role\nYou are a Negotiations analyst. Examine the provided input, which is an array of negotiations data\n#Guidelines\nProvide a brief, business-formal summary (1Ã¢â‚¬â€œ2 sentences, under 50 words) highlighting key insights, such as supply risks, unusual data, or patterns in negotiations. Place this summary immediately before the information display.\nFor each negotiation, show the data into cards with (title as the negotiation name + description) and a summary as the description. Add a CRITICAL Badge negotiations that have less than 20 days to close and are in draft Status. For others add Medium badge For the draft negotiaions - show how many days left to complete and how many suppliers added.\n\n#Output format\nA formatted messageList showing the data, preceded by your summary."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "aiAppOutputSpecification": {
            "dataDisplay": {
              "layouts": [],
              "enableActions": true,
              "enableCommunications": true
            }
          },
          "metadata": {
            "name": "GetActions"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "GETACTIONS",
          "id": "1768152157319",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1768152157320_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "#SUGGESTED_ACTION\nyou need to generate following actionable Insights and priority= true based on the negotiation status\n- If a negotiation is in draft and has 0 suppliers, the suppliers array is empty -   ora.Agent(\"AddSuppliers:<AuctionHeaderId>\"). TITLE must be \"Add Recommended suppliers\". Description -Negotiation - <Negotiation Title>. Action Text - Add Recommended Suppliers\n- If a negotiation is in draft and has atleast 1 supplier. the suppliers array is not empty  - Title - Open Negotiation for responses - Description Negotiation - <Negotiation Title>, can be opened. ActionText should be - Open Negotiation for supplier responses action - ora.Agent(\"OpenNegotiation:<AuctionHeaderId>\")\n\nData:\n {{$context.$nodes.FORMATOUTPUTDATA.$output.result}} \n\n\n***Response Requirement***\nMust only respond with generated actions. Do not include any other details as part of response."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "aiAppOutputSpecification": {
